message: "If you use this software, please cite the software and the MuMag2022 paper."
title: "MuMag2022 Python"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
authors:
  - family-names: Adams
    given-names: Michael P.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9269-8087"
abstract: >-
  MuMag2022 Python is a tested, browser-accessible implementation for fitting
  field-dependent unpolarized magnetic small-angle neutron-scattering data in
  the approach-to-saturation regime. It provides exchange-stiffness profiling,
  uncertainty-aware residual analysis, and numerical stability diagnostics.
repository-code: "https://github.com/AdamsMP92/MuMag2022_python"
url: "https://adamsmp92.github.io/MuMag2022_python/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - small-angle neutron scattering
  - magnetic SANS
  - micromagnetics
  - exchange stiffness
